          }
        },
        "text_8JneGh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>While guiding fly fishing trips in Wyoming and Alaska, I needed a cooler that was lightweight and flexible enough to fit in my pack for a full day of hiking upriver. Fast forward a few years in San Francisco, and I faced a similar challenge—whether biking or Ubering to the beach, traditional coolers were just too bulky. After hundreds of prototypes, I’m now a dad in Charleston, SC, juggling baby gear and two golden retrievers, always needing the best gear I can get. Building this brand has been an incredible journey, and I’d love for you to join us. Feel free to reach out with any questions or feedback!<br/><br/>-Sam, Founder</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
